NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for businesses in Bridgend and across South Wales. Every logo is designed by hand — no AI, no templates — and built to work at every size across every platform.

## Your brand is your first impression

Before a customer speaks to you, they've already made a judgement based on how your business looks. A professional logo signals that you're established and trustworthy. An amateurish or generic one sends the opposite message.

We work with tradespeople, service businesses, retailers, and start-ups across Bridgend and the surrounding area, giving them a visual identity that reflects what they actually do.

## What's included

- 5 initial logo concepts
- Revisions until you're completely happy
- Brand colour palette and typography choices
- Brand guidelines document
- All file formats: PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG

Full details on our [logo design service](/services/logo-design/) page.

## No AI. Designed by hand.

Every logo is drawn in Adobe Illustrator — no AI-generated artwork, no stock icons. Unique to your business.

## Pair it with your website

We design and build websites alongside brand identities. See our [web design service](/services/web-design/) or [view our portfolio](/portfolio/).

## Frequently asked questions

**How much does logo design cost?**

Contact us for a fixed-price quote with no hidden costs.

**How long does it take?**

Most projects are completed within 5–10 working days.

**Do I own the logo?**

Yes — full ownership of all files transfers to you on completion.

